{
  "name": "cannavec-science",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "description": "Primary-source-anchored cannabis-science plugin for the working researcher. Five commands (research / ask / discover / verify / rigor) over twenty-one curated science registries (≥ 230 rows), thirteen live-discovery lanes (PubMed, ChEMBL, ClinicalTrials.gov, PubChem, PharmGKB, RCSB PDB, Open Targets, GWAS Catalog, BindingDB, bioRxiv, medRxiv, Europe PMC, OpenAlex), deterministic GRADE grading, safety + banned-pattern + phytochemistry-rigor preflight, retraction enforcement at composition time, identifier verification (PMID / DOI / NCT / ChEMBL / UniProt), researcher-workflow scaffolders (PICO, power, GRADE evidence-profile, IRB protocol), and BibTeX / RIS / CSL-JSON bibliography export with inline GRADE. Researcher audience only (Constitution §IV). Stdlib-only Python ≥ 3.9. 2,336 unit tests green; 173 offline + 15 live eval prompts. Full v0.7 release notes in README.",
